      "urn": "urn:li:document:customer-segmentation-migration-rfc-42",
      "title": "RFC-42: Customer segmentation code migration",
      "body": "During the transition, derive customer_tier from segment_code using B=bronze, S=silver, and G=gold. Unknown codes must fail validation; do not silently coerce them.",
